      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:00.00",
      "end_raw": "00:01.80",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 1800,
      "text": "High overhead birds-eye shot looking straight down at the unkempt bed, where Catherine lies curled in a silk chemise against Father Thomas's bare chest.",
      "line_number": 14,
      "duration_ms": 1800
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B002",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 1,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:00.00",
      "end_raw": "00:02.00",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 2000,
      "text": "Father Thomas lies flat on his back, breathless, while Catherine rests beside him, her fingers tracing across his bare skin.",
      "line_number": 18,
      "duration_ms": 2000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B003",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 2,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:01.80",
      "end_raw": "00:07.00",
      "start_ms": 1800,
      "end_ms": 7000,
      "text": "Low-angle medium close-up on Catherine looking down adoringly into Father Thomas's face, a single candle flickering in the dark background.",
      "line_number": 22,
      "duration_ms": 5200
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B004",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 3,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "CATHERINE (Playful, Seductive)",
      "speaker": "CATHERINE",
      "delivery": [
        "Playful",
        "Seductive"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:01.80",
      "end_raw": "00:05.80",
      "start_ms": 1800,
      "end_ms": 5800,
      "text": "\"A man in your collar isn't supposed to have that much left in him, Thomas.\"",
      "line_number": 26,
      "duration_ms": 4000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B005",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 4,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:05.80",
      "end_raw": "00:07.20",
      "start_ms": 5800,
      "end_ms": 7200,
      "text": "Catherine runs her hand gently down his chest, smiling with triumphant affection.",
      "line_number": 30,
      "duration_ms": 1400
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B006",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 5,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:07.00",
      "end_raw": "00:11.80",
      "start_ms": 7000,
      "end_ms": 11800,
      "text": "Close-up on Father Thomas turning his head toward her on the pillow, his voice raspy and dry.",
      "line_number": 34,
      "duration_ms": 4800
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B007",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 6,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "FATHER THOMAS (Low, Ironical)",
      "speaker": "FATHER THOMAS",
      "delivery": [
        "Low",
        "Ironical"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:07.20",
      "end_raw": "00:11.20",
      "start_ms": 7200,
      "end_ms": 11200,
      "text": "\"A man in my collar isn't supposed to be in this bed at all.\"",
      "line_number": 38,
      "duration_ms": 4000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B008",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 7,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:11.80",
      "end_raw": "00:15.80",
      "start_ms": 11800,
      "end_ms": 15800,
      "text": "Close-up pushing in on Catherine as she leans lower over his face, her gaze sharpening with dangerous intimacy.",
      "line_number": 42,
      "duration_ms": 4000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B009",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 8,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "CATHERINE (Intense, Whispering)",
      "speaker": "CATHERINE",
      "delivery": [
        "Intense",
        "Whispering"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:12.00",
      "end_raw": "00:15.50",
      "start_ms": 12000,
      "end_ms": 15500,
      "text": "\"Then let's stop pretending this was only appetite.\"",
      "line_number": 46,
      "duration_ms": 3500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B010",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 9,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:15.80",
      "end_raw": "00:18.80",
      "start_ms": 15800,
      "end_ms": 18800,
      "text": "Medium two-shot from the side as both sit up in bed, sheets pulled up around their waists.",
      "line_number": 50,
      "duration_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B011",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 10,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "CATHERINE (Direct, Transactional)",
      "speaker": "CATHERINE",
      "delivery": [
        "Direct",
        "Transactional"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:16.80",
      "end_raw": "00:18.50",
      "start_ms": 16800,
      "end_ms": 18500,
      "text": "\"Name your price.\"",
      "line_number": 54,
      "duration_ms": 1700
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B012",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 11,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:18.80",
      "end_raw": "00:26.50",
      "start_ms": 18800,
      "end_ms": 26500,
      "text": "Medium profile close-up on Father Thomas sitting up tall and bare-chested, Catherine resting her hand firmly over his heart.",
      "line_number": 58,
      "duration_ms": 7700
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B013",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 12,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "FATHER THOMAS (Calculated, Demanding)",
      "speaker": "FATHER THOMAS",
      "delivery": [
        "Calculated",
        "Demanding"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:19.40",
      "end_raw": "00:25.00",
      "start_ms": 19400,
      "end_ms": 25000,
      "text": "\"The west territory. Tax collection, all of it. Routed through my office.\"",
      "line_number": 62,
      "duration_ms": 5600
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B014",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 13,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:26.50",
      "end_raw": "00:30.50",
      "start_ms": 26500,
      "end_ms": 30500,
      "text": "Slight pull back as Catherine pulls her hand back slightly, staring at him in disbelief.",
      "line_number": 66,
      "duration_ms": 4000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B015",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 14,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "CATHERINE (Scoffing, Incredulous)",
      "speaker": "CATHERINE",
      "delivery": [
        "Scoffing",
        "Incredulous"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:27.20",
      "end_raw": "00:30.20",
      "start_ms": 27200,
      "end_ms": 30200,
      "text": "\"That's not absolution, Thomas. That's a fortune.\"",
      "line_number": 70,
      "duration_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B016",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 15,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:30.50",
      "end_raw": "00:35.80",
      "start_ms": 30500,
      "end_ms": 35800,
      "text": "Two-shot centering on Father Thomas leaning toward her, his expression resolute and uncompromising.",
      "line_number": 74,
      "duration_ms": 5300
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B017",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 16,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "FATHER THOMAS (Steady, Cold)",
      "speaker": "FATHER THOMAS",
      "delivery": [
        "Steady",
        "Cold"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:31.00",
      "end_raw": "00:35.00",
      "start_ms": 31000,
      "end_ms": 35000,
      "text": "\"Absolution is free. Discretion has a price.\"",
      "line_number": 78,
      "duration_ms": 4000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B018",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 17,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:35.80",
      "end_raw": "00:39.80",
      "start_ms": 35800,
      "end_ms": 39800,
      "text": "Tight profile close-up between their faces, golden candlelight illuminating Catherine's jaw as she raises her hand to touch his cheek.",
      "line_number": 82,
      "duration_ms": 4000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B019",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 18,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "CATHERINE (Soft, Calculating)",
      "speaker": "CATHERINE",
      "delivery": [
        "Soft",
        "Calculating"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:36.50",
      "end_raw": "00:39.40",
      "start_ms": 36500,
      "end_ms": 39400,
      "text": "\"Unsupervised. In your hands alone.\"",
      "line_number": 86,
      "duration_ms": 2900
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B020",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 19,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:39.80",
      "end_raw": "00:43.00",
      "start_ms": 39800,
      "end_ms": 43000,
      "text": "Tight close-up as Father Thomas reaches up and firmly clasps Catherine's hand at his neck.",
      "line_number": 90,
      "duration_ms": 3200
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B021",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 20,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "FATHER THOMAS (Grave)",
      "speaker": "FATHER THOMAS",
      "delivery": [
        "Grave"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:40.40",
      "end_raw": "00:42.50",
      "start_ms": 40400,
      "end_ms": 42500,
      "text": "\"For as long as it holds.\"",
      "line_number": 94,
      "duration_ms": 2100
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B022",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 21,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:43.00",
      "end_raw": "00:48.50",
      "start_ms": 43000,
      "end_ms": 48500,
      "text": "Medium close-up as Catherine breaks into a knowing, seductive smile and taps his chest with her index finger.",
      "line_number": 98,
      "duration_ms": 5500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B023",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 22,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "CATHERINE (Softly, Teasing)",
      "speaker": "CATHERINE",
      "delivery": [
        "Softly",
        "Teasing"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:43.20",
      "end_raw": "00:48.00",
      "start_ms": 43200,
      "end_ms": 48000,
      "text": "\"Done. You told yourself this ends when the hearing does.\"",
      "line_number": 102,
      "duration_ms": 4800
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B024",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 23,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:48.50",
      "end_raw": "00:54.50",
      "start_ms": 48500,
      "end_ms": 54500,
      "text": "Close-up on Father Thomas letting out a soft, self-deprecating chuckle before meeting her eyes with smoldering hunger.",
      "line_number": 106,
      "duration_ms": 6000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B025",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 24,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "FATHER THOMAS (Chuckle, Resigned)",
      "speaker": "FATHER THOMAS",
      "delivery": [
        "Chuckle",
        "Resigned"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:49.80",
      "end_raw": "00:54.00",
      "start_ms": 49800,
      "end_ms": 54000,
      "text": "\"I've told myself that since the dawn in your bedchamber, and here we are again.\"",
      "line_number": 110,
      "duration_ms": 4200
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B026",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 25,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:54.50",
      "end_raw": "00:59.80",
      "start_ms": 54500,
      "end_ms": 59800,
      "text": "Extreme close-up of their lips almost grazing, warm candlelight catching the edges of their profiles.",
      "line_number": 114,
      "duration_ms": 5300
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B027",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 26,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "CATHERINE (Murmuring)",
      "speaker": "CATHERINE",
      "delivery": [
        "Murmuring"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:54.80",
      "end_raw": "00:56.50",
      "start_ms": 54800,
      "end_ms": 56500,
      "text": "\"In another room no one uses?\"",
      "line_number": 118,
      "duration_ms": 1700
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B028",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 27,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "FATHER THOMAS (Whispering)",
      "speaker": "FATHER THOMAS",
      "delivery": [
        "Whispering"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:56.80",
      "end_raw": "00:59.20",
      "start_ms": 56800,
      "end_ms": 59200,
      "text": "\"Perhaps I like rooms no one uses.\"",
      "line_number": 122,
      "duration_ms": 2400
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B029",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 28,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:59.80",
      "end_raw": "01:05.50",
      "start_ms": 59800,
      "end_ms": 65500,
      "text": "Close-up profile as Catherine slides both hands into the dark hair at the back of his neck, pulling him closer.",
      "line_number": 126,
      "duration_ms": 5700
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B030",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 29,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "CATHERINE (Low, Carnal)",
      "speaker": "CATHERINE",
      "delivery": [
        "Low",
        "Carnal"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "01:00.30",
      "end_raw": "01:04.80",
      "start_ms": 60300,
      "end_ms": 64800,
      "text": "\"Or perhaps discretion isn't the only thing you've developed a taste for.\"",
      "line_number": 130,
      "duration_ms": 4500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B031",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 30,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "01:05.50",
      "end_raw": "01:10.50",
      "start_ms": 65500,
      "end_ms": 70500,
      "text": "Medium two-shot as Father Thomas pulls Catherine into a fierce, suffocating embrace, burying his face in her neck while she clings to his broad shoulders.",
      "line_number": 134,
      "duration_ms": 5000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B032",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 31,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S01",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "01:05.80",
      "end_raw": "01:10.50",
      "start_ms": 65800,
      "end_ms": 70500,
      "text": "Catherine closes her eyes in surrender as Father Thomas holds her tight against his naked chest, lost in their forbidden entanglement.",
      "line_number": 138,
      "duration_ms": 4700
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP050_B033",
      "episode_id": "EP050",
      "file_index": 32,
      "scene_id": "EP050_S02",
